A sixth Scream film was announced just weeks after
the successful debut of Scream (2022).

16
01:12:53,333 --> 01:12:59,333
Much of the cast signed on to reprise their roles, with
Bettinelli-Olpin, Gillett, Vanderbilt, and Busick also returning.

17
