Neve Campbell did not reprise her role as Sidney Prescott due to a pay
dispute, making this the only Scream film not to feature her.

19
01:26:33,333 --> 01:26:39,333
Brian Tyler, who had scored the fifth film, returned to compose and conduct
the score, with Sven Faulconer joining Tyler as a co-composer.

20
01:31:06,666 --> 01:31:12,666
Scream VI premiered at the AMC Lincoln Square Theater in Manhattan on March 6, 2023, and was
theatrically released in the United States on March 10 by Paramount Pictures.

21
01:35:40,000 --> 01:35:46,000
The film received generally positive reviews from critics, who praised the fresh setting
for the franchise, the increased violence, and the performances of the cast.

22
01:40:13,333 --> 01:40:19,333
It grossed $169 million worldwide, becoming the first installment in the franchise to earn over $100 million at the domestic US box
office since Scream 2 (1997) and the highest-grossing Scream film in the United States and Canada (unadjusted for inflation).

23
01:44:46,666 --> 01:44:52,666
